  "title": "My Kid's Favorite Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "This simple recipe for zucchini bread makes two generous loaves and helps to use up all those extra zucchini that seem to “crop” up each year!",
  "authors": [
    "Lynnsthings"
  ],
